  "problem": "Residual extraction depended on launching an external coding harness. Missing credentials, unsupported structured outputs or a missing exact model could fail open. Provider transport success could be treated as claim acceptance. The public Worker request path could import a model client. Paid OpenRouter calls could run without a provisioned budget/key.",
  "resulting_behavior": "createProviderRequest binds model/endpoint identity, prompt hash, evidence IDs, JSON schema, token limits and timeout. Credentials are read only through an injected secretProvider.getSecret port and never placed on the request object. Missing credentials, unsupported structured outputs and a missing exact model fail closed with no silent fallback. executeOpenRouterRequest uses an injected transport, requires paidCallsEnabled, and rejects malformed JSON, truncated output, provider errors and schema-valid but unsupported fields without publishing claims. runResidualJob connects the PR-021 residual-job port to the adapter and refuses to launch dsh. worker/index.mjs does not import packages/enrichment. PAID_CALLS_ENABLED remains false. Provider transport success is not claim acceptance. Live fetch is forbidden.",
